(FIELD NOTES ON QUIET PLACES) Tj T*
(An original short collection by Common Room Studio) Tj T*
(CC0 - made for this demonstration collection, 2026) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I. THE WINDOW) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(There is a tree outside the window that I have been meaning to identify for three) Tj T*
(years. Each spring I make a small promise to find its name. Each summer the) Tj T*
(promise disappears behind the leaves.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Today I put down the book about trees and looked at the tree itself. A branch) Tj T*
(moved. Another did not. In the space between them was a piece of pale sky, no) Tj T*
(larger than an envelope.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Knowing a name is one way of paying attention. Looking is another. I am trying to) Tj T*
(make room for both.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The morning continued without an announcement. Someone wheeled a bicycle through) Tj T*
(the courtyard. A kettle switched itself off. The world offered its ordinary sounds) Tj T*
(and asked nothing of me.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I wrote down: a quiet place is not always a place without noise.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(II. THE PATH) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(The path begins behind a gate that no longer closes. A stone holds it open, though) Tj T*
(the stone has been there so long that its purpose now seems ceremonial.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(In the first hundred steps, the town is still with you. There is the road, the) Tj T*
(school, the delivery van reversing. Then the path turns, and the sounds fold into) Tj T*
(one another until they become a kind of weather.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(I used to walk this way to get somewhere. Now I sometimes walk to the bend and) Tj T*
(return. There is nothing at the bend. That is part of its appeal.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(On a wet afternoon I found a leaf pressed flat against a stone. Its veins were so) Tj T*
(fine that I had to crouch to see them. While I was looking, someone passed and) Tj T*
(said hello. We shared the small embarrassment of having interrupted nothing) Tj T*
(important.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Later I wondered how much of a life is made from things that seem unimportant at) Tj T*
(the time.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(III. THE SHORE) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
